{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now, somewhere in your home, there\nis a small stack of bills you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4982,
    "dDurationMs": 3902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paid so many times that you barely even\nlook at them anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9525,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The power company. The pharmacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12186,
    "dDurationMs": 5623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The county tax office. You open them, you\npay them, and you move on, the way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17809,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have done for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20030,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here is something that almost no one\nyour age is ever told."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25733,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six of those bills can be cut down, and a\nfew of them wiped out completely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30755,
    "dDurationMs": 3142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with nothing more than a phone call to the\nright place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34497,
    "dDurationMs": 5863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money is real. It is already set aside\nfor people in exactly your situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40860,
    "dDurationMs": 4423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the only reason you are still paying\nthe full amount is that not one of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45283,
    "dDurationMs": 4842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those companies will ever call you first\nto say you have been paying too much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50785,
    "dDurationMs": 3122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do one thing for me before we start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54507,
    "dDurationMs": 3802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Find your phone, and keep it right next to\nyou while you watch this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58789,
    "dDurationMs": 4563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because by the end, you are going to have\na short list of calls that could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63352,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "put thousands of dollars a year back into\nyour pocket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66814,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will take you through all six, one at a\ntime, in plain words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71916,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What each bill is, who gets to stop paying\nit, and the exact call that fixes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76478,
    "dDurationMs": 4943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. And I am saving the biggest one for\nthe very end, because it is the largest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81421,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "check most of you write all year, and the\ncall that brings it down takes about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86403,
    "dDurationMs": 5443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ten minutes. The first bill is the one\nclimbing the fastest right now, in this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91846,
    "dDurationMs": 5023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heat, and that is your home energy bill,\nthe cost of keeping your house cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97369,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in these hot months, there are two\nthings working in your favor that most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101991,
    "dDurationMs": 4983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people never hear about. First, a growing\nnumber of states have made it against"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106974,
    "dDurationMs": 4362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rules for the power company to shut\noff your electricity during the hottest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111336,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "part of the summer, so if you have fallen\nbehind, they cannot leave an older"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116138,
    "dDurationMs": 2882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person without cooling in dangerous heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119640,
    "dDurationMs": 4362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, there is a program, paid for by\nthe government and run by your own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124002,
    "dDurationMs": 4382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "state, that helps older people pay their\nheating and cooling bills, and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128384,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will even help cover a fan or a window air\nconditioner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132106,
    "dDurationMs": 3882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called the Low Income Home Energy\nAssistance Program."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136629,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Older people are moved right to the front\nof the line for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140250,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here is the part that makes this a\ncall for this week and not someday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145613,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money set aside for summer cooling is\nsmaller than the winter fund, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150515,
    "dDurationMs": 4863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it runs out in the middle of the season,\nso the people who call early are the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155378,
    "dDurationMs": 5283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ones who actually get it. The phone call\nthat fixes this one is to your state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160661,
    "dDurationMs": 5562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "energy assistance office, and the question\nis, what cooling help and what shutoff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166223,
    "dDurationMs": 2402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protection is there for a senior on my\nbill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169085,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second bill is the one you hand over\nat the pharmacy counter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173527,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As of this year, there is a hard limit,\nwritten right into federal law, on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178690,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much you can be made to pay out of\nyour own pocket for your covered prescriptions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183212,
    "dDurationMs": 5683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a whole year. That limit is about two\nthousand one hundred dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188895,
    "dDurationMs": 3722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once what you have paid for your covered\nmedicine reaches that number, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192617,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are done for the rest of the year, and\nyour drug plan has to pay for all of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196859,
    "dDurationMs": 4822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it after that. If you take an expensive\nmedicine, the kind that used to cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201681,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people ten or fifteen thousand dollars a\nyear, that can simply never happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206223,
    "dDurationMs": 2592,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to you again. And there is more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208815,
    "dDurationMs": 4612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If money is tight for you, there is a\nprogram called Extra Help, run through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213427,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Social Security, that lowers what you pay\nfor your medicine, your copays at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217989,
    "dDurationMs": 5563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the counter, and even your drug plan\npremium, often down to just a few dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224393,
    "dDurationMs": 4602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody should be splitting pills in half\nto save money while help worth thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228995,
    "dDurationMs": 2541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of dollars sits there with their name on\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231936,
    "dDurationMs": 4883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it will not come to you. The phone\ncall that fixes this one is to your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236819,
    "dDurationMs": 4062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drug plan, or to Social Security, and the\nquestion is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241561,
    "dDurationMs": 4743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I signed up for Extra Help, and how\ndoes the yearly cap on my medicine work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247264,
    "dDurationMs": 3502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one call can change what you pay all\nyear long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251186,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third bill comes straight out of your\nSocial Security check every single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255608,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "month, so quietly that most people forget\nthey are even paying it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260050,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is your Medicare Part B premium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262922,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This year it is about two hundred and\nthree dollars a month, which comes to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267324,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than two thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270766,
    "dDurationMs": 3582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "four hundred dollars a year, taken out of\nyour check before you ever see a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274348,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "penny of it. But here is what almost no\none knows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276369,
    "dDurationMs": 5162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you get by on Social Security and not a\nlot more, there are programs, called"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281531,
    "dDurationMs": 4262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Medicare Savings Programs, that will\npay that whole premium for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286094,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money that has been disappearing from\nyour check every month goes right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290836,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back into it, for the rest of your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294378,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great many people never even check,\nbecause they decide on their own that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298960,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they must earn too much to qualify, and\nthey are very often wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304002,
    "dDurationMs": 2362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The limits are higher than most people\nexpect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307244,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The phone call that fixes this one is to\nthe office in your state that handles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311586,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Medicaid, and the question is, do I\nqualify for a Medicare Savings Program"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317049,
    "dDurationMs": 1881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pay my Part B premium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319690,
    "dDurationMs": 4703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the answer is yes, that is more than\ntwo thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325633,
    "dDurationMs": 710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "four hundred dollars a year put back in\nyour pocket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326594,
    "dDurationMs": 3922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth bill is not one that comes in\nthe mail at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330996,
    "dDurationMs": 5063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the money quietly taken out of your\nown bank account, in fees, every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336059,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337719,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A charge just for having the account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340701,
    "dDurationMs": 3912,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another charge when a payment goes through\nand your balance is running low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345353,
    "dDurationMs": 4322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For an older person living on a fixed\ncheck, these can add up to well over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350256,
    "dDurationMs": 3742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a hundred dollars a year, pulled straight\nout of your own savings, for nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353998,
    "dDurationMs": 3601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at all. And here is what the bank will\nnever tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357940,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Almost every bank has an account with no\nmonthly fee, and many now offer one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363002,
    "dDurationMs": 3802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built just for older customers, with the\nfees waived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366864,
    "dDurationMs": 4442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They simply do not move you over to it,\nbecause those fees are money in their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371306,
    "dDurationMs": 400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pocket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372507,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The phone call that fixes this one is to\nyour own bank, and the question is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377389,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you have an account with no monthly\nfee, and will you switch me to it today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382172,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One short call can stop money from leaking\nout of your account for the rest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386714,
    "dDurationMs": 5143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your life. The fifth bill is one almost\nnobody thinks to question, and that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391857,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is your phone and your internet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394418,
    "dDurationMs": 5142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a great many older people, this has\nquietly become one more bill eating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399560,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a fixed check every month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402142,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is a federal program, called\nLifeline, that takes a set amount straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407244,
    "dDurationMs": 4623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off the cost of your phone or your\ninternet every single month, for people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411867,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who qualify."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413347,
    "dDurationMs": 3742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most older people living mainly on\nSocial Security do qualify."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417589,
    "dDurationMs": 4903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not a fortune, but it is money off\nthe same bill every month, month after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422492,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "month, for as long as you keep the\nservice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425233,
    "dDurationMs": 5863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, many phone and internet\ncompanies have their own low cost plans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431096,
    "dDurationMs": 5063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for older customers that they do not\nadvertise, because they would rather you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436159,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keep paying full price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438440,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The phone call that fixes this one is to\nyour phone or your internet company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443002,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the question is, do you have the\nLifeline discount, or a low cost plan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448165,
    "dDurationMs": 2601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for seniors, and how do I sign up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451226,
    "dDurationMs": 4062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few minutes on the phone, and your bill\nis smaller every month from then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455288,
    "dDurationMs": 6003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on. And the sixth bill, the biggest check\nmost of you write all year, is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461291,
    "dDurationMs": 6223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your property tax. If you own your home,\nthis is very often the single largest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467514,
    "dDurationMs": 4963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bill you face, and it keeps climbing as\nyour home is valued higher, even while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472477,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your income stays flat. But nearly every\nstate gives people sixty five and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477580,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "older a way to fight back, and there are\ntwo separate ways to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482382,
    "dDurationMs": 5803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is a freeze. The day you\nqualify, the value your home is taxed on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488185,
    "dDurationMs": 5142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is locked in place, so even as the houses\naround you keep rising and your neighbors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493327,
    "dDurationMs": 4763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watch their bills grow, yours stays frozen\nfor as long as you live there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498730,
    "dDurationMs": 5563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second is a rebate, an actual check\nsent back to you for part of the property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504293,
    "dDurationMs": 4822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax you already paid, and in a number of\nstates those checks are going out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509115,
    "dDurationMs": 1901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to seniors this very summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511837,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on where you live, that check\ncan be worth several hundred dollars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515959,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in some places well over a thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519340,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me make this one real for a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522302,
    "dDurationMs": 4282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are people all over this country who\nhave lived in the same paid off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526584,
    "dDurationMs": 5983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "house for forty years, on nothing but a\nSocial Security check, watching a property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532567,
    "dDurationMs": 5263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax bill climb past four or five thousand\ndollars, and growing more frightened"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537830,
    "dDurationMs": 5623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single year of losing the very home\nthey already own, over a bill for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543453,
    "dDurationMs": 5242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taxes. If they simply picked up the phone\nand asked for the freeze, or filed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548695,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the rebate, that weight would lift,\nand much of that money would either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553097,
    "dDurationMs": 2562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stop growing or come straight back to\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556019,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But no one at the county has ever once\ncalled to tell them the programs were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560421,
    "dDurationMs": 5683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there. The phone call that fixes this one\nis to your county, and the question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566104,
    "dDurationMs": 5323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is, do you have a property tax freeze, an\nexemption, or a rebate for seniors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571927,
    "dDurationMs": 5503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how do I apply. It may be the most\nvaluable phone call you make all year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577630,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now step back and look at what all six of\nthese share, because it is the very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582492,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same thread running through every one of\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585414,
    "dDurationMs": 5843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The help is real. The programs already\nexist, paid for and running, written"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591257,
    "dDurationMs": 4822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for exactly your situation. And not a\nsingle one of them will ever come looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596079,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for you. The power company stays quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599501,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The county does not knock. The drug plan\ndoes not call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603383,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bank says nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605284,
    "dDurationMs": 4482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are all counting on your silence, and\non a lifetime of habit that tells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609766,
    "dDurationMs": 3802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you to just pay, and just cope, and never\nask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614248,
    "dDurationMs": 5183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that is your money, earned over a\nwhole lifetime of work, and keeping it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619431,
    "dDurationMs": 2581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be as simple as a few phone calls this\nweek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622292,
    "dDurationMs": 3582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is your list, six calls to make\nthis week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626294,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One. Call your state energy assistance\noffice and ask about summer cooling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630936,
    "dDurationMs": 2602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "help and shutoff protection for a senior."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634078,
    "dDurationMs": 5363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two. Call your drug plan, or Social\nSecurity, and ask about Extra Help and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639441,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the yearly cap on your medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641762,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three. Call the office in your state that\nhandles Medicaid and ask about the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646484,
    "dDurationMs": 3022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Medicare Savings Programs that pay your\nPart B premium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650346,
    "dDurationMs": 4743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Four. Call your bank and ask to be\nswitched to an account with no monthly fee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655949,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five. Call your phone and internet company\nand ask about the Lifeline discount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660871,
    "dDurationMs": 2682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and any low cost plan for older customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664573,
    "dDurationMs": 5283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And six. Call your county and ask about\nthe senior property tax freeze, exemption,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670216,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or rebate. Every one of these is free to\nask about, and the exact rules are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674758,
    "dDurationMs": 3922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different in every state, so let each one\ntell you what you qualify for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678901,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is general information to help you\nknow what to ask for, and it is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684323,
    "dDurationMs": 1461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "legal or tax advice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686504,
    "dDurationMs": 4803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I have put where to start for each one\nof these in the description just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691307,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "below this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693848,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And before you go, think of one person who\nis quietly overpaying every one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699311,
    "dDurationMs": 3381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these bills without ever knowing there\nwas another way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703173,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A parent. A neighbor. An old friend\ngetting by on a small check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708776,
    "dDurationMs": 4842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Send them this video. It could put\nthousands of dollars a year back in their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713618,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pocket."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714698,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then go and make one of these calls for\nyourself this week, and help someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718901,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you love make theirs."
    } ]
  } ]
}
